      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Inline path",
      "items": [
        "Booking joins the producer's own transaction",
        "A failure rolls the producer back; the provider or caller retries",
        "The outbox row is kept and marked processed as evidence"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Outbox path",
      "items": [
        "The producer never blocks on finance work",
        "Five attempts with 15s to 1h backoff, then terminal failed",
        "The pollers start only with QUEUE_DRIVER=redis"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Workerless consumers",
      "items": [
        "Drain cron calls /v1/internal/jobs/drain: finance, checkout, inventory, refunds, payout",
        "Inventory publish, checkout retry, refund reconciliation and payout run have no inline path",
        "A stopped cron leaves pending rows, visible in outbox_events"
      ]
